abstract: >-
  Cloud-synchronized digital pocketbook (Buku Saku Digital), 38-Polda and
  28-function Tour of Duty directory, executive welfare analytics (Anev),
  delegated Aide-de-Camp (ADC) governance, and dual-chamber social fund
  portal engineered for Paguyuban Alumni Akademi Kepolisian (Akpol) 1996
  — Batalyon Wira Satya (261 verified senior officers).
